msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Taiga「......Yes?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Sí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's me. I came to check on you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Soy yo. Vine a ver cómo estás.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Mind your own business.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Métete en tus asuntos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kushieda asked me to. She said you＿were acting weird, and asked me to＿stop by.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Kushieda me lo pidió. Dijo que＿estabas actuando raro, y me pidió＿que pasara a verte.」"

msgid "Taiga「Huh......? Minorin......?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Eh......? ¿Minorin......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey, are you having some kind of＿trouble? If I'm no good, you know you＿can call Yasuko, right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye, ¿tienes algún problema? Si＿yo no sirvo, sabes que puedes＿llamar a Yasuko, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Taiga「That's not it, okay? That's not it,＿but............」"
msgstr "Taiga「No es eso, ¿sí? No es eso,＿pero............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Taiga?」"

msgid "Taiga「..................Tch.」"
msgstr "Taiga「..................Tch.」"

msgid "Taiga「Get in here.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Pasa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yo. What's up? Feeling sick?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Hola. ¿Qué pasa? ¿Te sientes mal?」"

msgid "Taiga「I feel fine.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Me siento bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You didn't eat breakfast, did you? I＿went to the trouble of cooking you＿some.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No desayunaste, ¿verdad? Me tomé la＿molestia de prepararte algo de comer.」"

msgid "Taiga「I had breakfast. You didn't have to＿cook for me.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí desayuné. No tenías＿que cocinar para mí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright, I stand corrected. But I bet all＿you ate was junk, right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien, me retracto. Pero apuesto＿a que solo comiste chatarra, ¿no?」"

msgid "Taiga「Shut up. Just drop it already.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Cállate. Ya deja el tema.」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't go touching my stuff!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡No andes tocando mis cosas!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? What's your problem?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? ¿Qué te pasa?」"

msgid "Taiga「It was a mistake to let you in here after＿all. Now go home.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Al final fue un error dejarte entrar＿aquí. Ahora vete a tu casa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm sorry, okay? I'm sorry! I won't pry＿any further. So, what's the matter?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Perdón, ¿sí? ¡Lo siento! Ya no voy a＿husmear más. Entonces, ¿qué ocurre?」"

msgid "Taiga「......Tch.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Tch.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kushieda was concerned about you.＿She thought you might be in some kind＿of trouble.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Kushieda estaba preocupada por＿ti. Pensó que podrías estar en＿algún tipo de aprieto.」"

msgid "Taiga「............Just so we're clear, this will just＿be an emergency precaution.」"
msgstr "Taiga「............Que quede claro, esto será＿solo una medida de emergencia.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What are you talking about?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿De qué estás hablando?」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm woo, w-WOEfully reluctant, but I＿really have no other choice but to ask＿you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Me da mu, m-MUCHO pesar hacerlo,＿pero en verdad no me queda más＿remedio que pedírtelo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright. I understand, so tell me what's＿going on.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bien. Entiendo, así que＿dime qué está pasando.」"

msgid "Taiga「......This way.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Por aquí.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Here.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Aquí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, a scarf. That's some high-quality＿cashmere. But it looks like it shrank.＿MOTTAINAI!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oh, una bufanda. Es de cachemira de＿muy buena calidad. Pero parece que＿se encogió. ¡QUÉ DESPERDICIO!」"

msgid "Taiga「That's it?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Eso es todo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What do you mean?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿A qué te refieres?」"

msgid "Taiga「This is your scarf, Ryuuji.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Esta es tu bufanda, Ryuuji.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Mine?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mía?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah, the scarf you were taking such＿good care of......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí, la bufanda que cuidabas＿con tanto esmero......」"

msgid "Taiga「I took it from you and wore it. I knew I＿should return it, but when I washed＿it......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Te la quité y me la puse. Sabía＿que debía devolvértela, pero＿cuando la lavé......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, yeah. All handmade stuff ends up＿like this if you try to machine wash it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, sí. Toda prenda hecha a mano＿queda así si la metes a la lavadora.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well then, why are YOU upset about＿it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, entonces, ¿por qué TÚ＿estás molesta por esto?」"

msgid "Taiga「W-Well...... I screwed it up............ *Sniff*」"
msgstr "Taiga「B-Bueno......＿La arruiné............ *Snif*」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Save the tears for later. So, you want＿to make it good as new, huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Guarda las lágrimas para después. ¿Así＿que quieres dejarla como nueva, eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「Is it possible?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Es posible?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, as I recall, there is a way...... Let's＿see......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, según recuerdo, hay una＿forma...... Veamos......」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ryuuji......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Come on, dammit, remember! There's＿definitely a way to do it! Come on,＿synapses! Work, brain cells!!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡Vamos, maldición, recuerda! ¡Seguro＿hay una forma de hacerlo! ¡Vamos,＿sinapsis! ¡Trabajen, neuronas!!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, I remember. Taiga, you have a＿ton of useless conditioners and other＿hair products, right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ah, ya recuerdo. Taiga, tienes un＿montón de acondicionadores inútiles y＿productos para el cabello, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Taiga「Huh? What? Conditioner? Hair＿products?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Eh? ¿Qué? ¿Acondicionador? ¿Productos＿para el cabello?」"

msgid "Taiga「Huh? Oh, okay!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Eh? ¡Ah, está bien!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Okay, it's been about 30 minutes.＿Let's go check on it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Listo, ya pasaron unos 30＿minutos. Vamos a revisarla.」"

msgid "Taiga「Whoa...... Incredible......!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Vaya...... ¡Increíble......!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, it expanded. I can't really＿remember what it was like before it＿shrank. Is this close enough?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oh, se estiró. La verdad no recuerdo＿bien cómo era antes de encogerse.＿¿Así está bastante bien?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah, it's practically good as new!＿That's amazing!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Sí, está prácticamente como＿nueva! ¡Es asombroso!」"

msgid "Taiga「Hmmm......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Mmmm......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Next, gently wring it out, lay it flat to＿dry, and it'll be A-OK. Good news, eh＿Taiga?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Luego, exprímela suavemente, déjala＿secar en plano y quedará perfecta.＿Buenas noticias, ¿eh, Taiga?」"

msgid "Taiga「Y-Yeah...... Wait, but it's YOUR scarf.」"
msgstr "Taiga「S-Sí...... Espera, pero es TU bufanda.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh yeah. Anyway, it's all taken care of.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, cierto. En fin, ya está resuelto.」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah...... you're right.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí...... tienes razón.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What? All of a sudden you're down in＿the dumps again.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué? De repente te volviste＿a desanimar.」"

msgid "Taiga「In the end, you had to come to my＿rescue...... I just hate how helpless I am.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Al final tuviste que venir a mi＿rescate...... Odio lo inútil que soy.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's nothing you need to worry＿about.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No tienes por qué preocuparte por eso.」"

msgid "Taiga「I DO worry! I ended up being totally＿useless!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡SÍ me preocupa! ¡Terminé siendo＿una completa inútil!」"

msgid "Taiga「............No, that's not right. It's not your＿fault. Sorry, forget what I just said.」"
msgstr "Taiga「............No, no es eso. No es tu＿culpa. Perdón, olvida lo que dije.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Taiga?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Taiga?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien......」"

msgid "Taiga「Please, just...... get out......!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Por favor, solo...... ¡vete......!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright, I understand!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Bien, entiendo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Heeey, it's time to get up! Lunch is＿ready!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Oye, ya es hora de levantarse!＿¡El almuerzo está listo!」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yawwwn～ Already awake～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Bostezooo～ Ya estoy despiertaaa～」"

msgid "Inko-chan「MOR, MORNING!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡BUE, BUENOS DÍAS!」"

msgid "Yasuko「Morning, Inko-chan～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Buenos días, Inko-chan～」"

msgid "Yasuko「Morning, Ryuu-chan～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Buenos días, Ryuu-chan～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, good morning. Food's ready, so＿clear off the kotatsu, please.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, buenos días. La comida＿está lista, así que despeja＿el kotatsu, por favor.」"

msgid "Yasuko「'Kaaay～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Bieeen～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（That reminds me, I need to make＿Yasuko explain just what relationship＿she and I have.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Ahora que lo recuerdo, tengo que＿hacer que Yasuko me explique qué＿relación tenemos ella y yo.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Well, I'm in no rush......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Bueno, no tengo prisa......）」"

msgid "Yasuko「Wow, looks yummy. Thanks for the＿food～☆」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¡Vaya, se ve delicioso! ¡Gracias＿por la comida～☆」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Let's eat!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡A comer!」"

msgid "Yasuko「......Hey Ryuu-chan, is Taiga-chan really＿not going to come over for fooddd?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「......Oye, Ryuu-chan, ¿Taiga-chan de＿verdad no va a venir a comeeer?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, the way she is now, she won't be＿coming over for a while yet.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, tal como está ahora, no vendrá＿por un buen tiempo todavía.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Oh, reallyyy......? Yacchan's＿mega-lonely, gansuuu.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ah, ¿en seriooo......? Yacchan＿está mega-sola, gansuuu.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't say that. She's seriously trying to＿prepare for the future, it seems.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No digas eso. Parece que en＿serio está tratando de prepararse＿para el futuro.」"

msgid "Yasuko「But, but, aren't you lonely too,＿Ryuu-channn?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Pero, pero, ¿tú no te sientes＿solo también, Ryuu-chaaan?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I...... Maybe.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Yo...... Tal vez.」"

msgid "Yasuko「No two ways about it, you made＿enough food for at least 3 peopleee.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「No hay duda, hiciste comida suficiente＿para al menos 3 personaaas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, I accidentally made too much.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ah, hice demasiado sin querer.」"

msgid "Yasuko「That's becauseee Ryuu-chan's part of＿a 3-person familyyy. Yacchan feels the＿same wayyy.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Eso es porqueee Ryuu-chan es parte＿de una familia de 3 personaaas.＿Yacchan siente lo mismooo.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Come onnn, at least try talking to＿herrr.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Vamooos, al menos intenta＿hablar con ellaaa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「She said she was going out. She's not＿at home right now.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Dijo que iba a salir. No está＿en casa ahora mismo.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Reallyyy? Thennn, invite her over for＿dinner at leasttt.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿En seriooo? Entonceees, invítala＿a cenar al menosss.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay, I will.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien, lo haré.」"

msgid "Yasuko「*Gasp* Today's the day Yacchan was＿supposed to leave early to go＿shopping for the bar...... Nnnn～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¡Ah! Hoy era el día en que Yacchan＿tenía que salir temprano a hacer compras＿para el bar...... Mmmm～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright, I'll be sure to tell her to come＿over sometime. Come on, that food's＿not going to eat itself.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bien, sin falta le diré que venga＿algún día. Vamos, esa comida no＿se va a comer sola.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Okaaay～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Está bieeen～」"

msgid "Yasuko「Okay, off to workkk!」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¡Bien, me voy al trabajooo!」"

msgid "Yasuko「I'm counting on youuu～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Cuento contigooo～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay. Take care.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí. Cuídate.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Now then......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Ahora bien......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（What should I do......? After all that＿loafing around, now would be a good＿time.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Qué debería hacer......? Después＿de holgazanear tanto, ahora sería＿un buen momento.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「..................」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「..................」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（For some reason...... Even though there＿should be plenty for me to do......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Por alguna razón...... Aunque debería＿tener mucho que hacer......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Oh, that reminds me, Taiga told me to＿\"prepare myself\"...... Uhh, well, not that＿it matters...... or anything......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Ah, ahora que lo recuerdo, Taiga me＿dijo que me \"preparara\"...... Eh, bueno,＿no es que importe...... ni nada......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Dammit.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Maldición.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Can't I do anything without Taiga＿around......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Es que no puedo hacer nada＿sin Taiga cerca......?）」"

msgid "Inko-chan「EN...... ENEMY! ENEMY ENEMY!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡EN...... ENEMIGO! ¡ENEMIGO ENEMIGO!」"

msgid "Inko-chan「ENEM, EN, ENEMA?」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「ENEM, EN, ¿ENEMA?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I retract my statement. You're in＿charge while I'm gone.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Retiro lo dicho. Te quedas＿a cargo mientras no estoy.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「HA, HAVE, FUNEMA!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡DI, DIVIÉRTETEMA!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then what about cleaning? It was＿spotless in here just the other day, but＿now look at the state of it! Jeez, you're」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Y entonces qué hay de limpiar? El otro＿día estaba impecable aquí, ¡y mira cómo＿está ahora! Cielos, eres」"

msgid "Ryuuji「hopeless.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「un caso perdido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Come to think of it, yeah...... Oh, I＿remember. That's certainly mine. But＿why is it at your house in this」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ahora que lo pienso, sí...... Ah,＿ya recuerdo. Sin duda es mía. ¿Pero por＿qué está en tu casa en este」"

msgid "Ryuuji「condition?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「estado?」"

msgid "Taiga「That's it!? Ryuuji, aren't you upset?＿This was the scarf you handled with＿the utmost care! Yacchan bought it」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Eso es todo?! Ryuuji, ¿no estás＿molesto? ¡Esta era la bufanda que＿cuidabas con tanto esmero! ¡Yacchan la」"

msgid "Taiga「with her hard-earned money!」"
msgstr "Taiga「compró con el dinero que＿tanto le costó ganar!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Let's see, where did I put them? I know＿there's a bunch around here＿somewhere...... Can you go and bring」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A ver, ¿dónde los puse? Sé que hay＿un montón por aquí en alguna parte......＿¿Puedes ir a traer」"

msgid "Ryuuji「me all the ones you have in the＿bathroom?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「todos los que tienes en el baño?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Cashmere is made from deer or rabbit＿fur, after all. Applying conditioner＿softens the fur, making it effective」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「La cachemira está hecha de pelo de＿ciervo o conejo, después de todo. El＿acondicionador lo suaviza y es eficaz」"

msgid "Ryuuji「against shrinkage.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「contra el encogimiento.」"

msgid "Taiga「Here I am, saying I'll be independent,＿but causing Minorin to worry! And＿THEN getting myself rescued by you!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Aquí estoy, diciendo que seré＿independiente, ¡pero preocupando a＿Minorin! ¡Y LUEGO me rescatas tú!」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah, why are you even h......!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí, ¡¿por qué estás siquiera aq......?!」"

msgid "Taiga「Thank you so much for helping with＿the scarf. I'll give it back once it's dry.＿Now then, I'm heading out, so if you」"
msgstr "Taiga「Muchas gracias por ayudar con la＿bufanda. Te la devolveré cuando se＿seque. Ahora voy a salir, así que si」"

msgid "Taiga「don't mind, go home.」"
msgstr "Taiga「no te importa, vete a casa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（When I try to think about it, I'm＿overcome with this weird feeling......＿What the hell is this guilt that keeps）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Cuando trato de pensar en ello, me＿invade esta sensación extraña...... ¿Qué＿demonios es esta culpa que me）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（me from talking about it......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（impide hablar de ello......?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I tried to make something decent out＿of the leftovers from New Year's. At＿least I was able to use them before」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Traté de hacer algo decente con＿las sobras de Año Nuevo. Al menos＿pude usarlas antes de que」"

msgid "Ryuuji「they went bad.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「se echaran a perder.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Maybe I'll go grocery shopping for＿tonight's dinner...... Oh, I'm eating alone＿tonight...... In that case, I could just）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Quizá vaya de compras para la cena＿de hoy...... Ah, hoy ceno solo......＿En ese caso, podría simplemente）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（make whatever......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（preparar cualquier cosa......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Ugh. Alright, for the time being I'll＿go shopping. Since I'm eating alone, I＿think I'll treat myself. Yeah, that」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ugh. Bueno, por lo pronto iré＿de compras. Ya que ceno solo, creo＿que me daré un gusto. Sí, eso」"

msgid "Ryuuji「sounds good.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「suena bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ohh......? Inko-chan, that's some bad＿timing. You completely ruined my fun.＿But you're right. Like you said,」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ohh......? Inko-chan, qué mal momento.＿Me arruinaste la diversión por completo.＿Pero tienes razón. Como dices,」"

msgid "Ryuuji「indulgence is the enemy.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「darse gustos es el enemigo.」"
